t now our rulers","strong":"H8269"},{"text":" of all the congregation","strong":"H6951"},{"text":" stand","strong":"H5975"},{"text":", and let all them which have taken","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" strange","strong":"H5237"},{"text":" wives","strong":"H802"},{"text":" in our cities","strong":"H5892"},{"text":" come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" at appointed","strong":"H2163"},{"text":" times","strong":"H6256"},{"text":", and with them the elders","strong":"H2205"},{"text":" of every city","strong":"H5892"},{"text":", and the judges","strong":"H8199"},{"text":" thereof, until the fierce","strong":"H2740"},{"text":" wrath","strong":"H639"},{"text":" of our God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" for this matter","strong":"H1697"},{"text":" be turned","strong":"H7725"},{"text":" from us. {for this...: or, till this matter be dispatched}"}]},{"id":12267,"title":"Ezra 10:15","segments":["¶Only Jonathan the son of Asahel and Jahaziah the son of Tikvah were employed about this [matter]: and Meshullam and Shabbethai the Levite helped them. {were...: Heb. stood}"],"ref":"Ezra 10:15","verse":15,"words":[{"text":"¶Only Jonathan","strong":"H3129"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Asahel","strong":"H6214"},{"text":" and Jahaziah","strong":"H3167"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Tikvah","strong":"H8616"},{"text":" were employed","strong":"H5975"},{"text":" about this [matter]: and Meshullam","strong":"H4918"},{"text":" and Shabbethai","strong":"H7678"},{"text":" the Levite","strong":"H3881"},{"text":" helped","strong":"H5826"},{"text":" them. {were...: Heb. stood}"}]},{"id":12268,"title":"Ezra 10:16","segments":["And the children of the captivity did so. And Ezra the priest, [with] certain chief of the fathers, after the house of their fathers, and all of them by [their] names, were separated, and sat down in the first day of the tenth month to examine the matter."],"ref":"Ezra 10:16","verse":16,"words":[{"text":"And the children","strong":"H1121"},{"tex